<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>ZipRunner review</title><style>
:root{font:16px system-ui;color:#eff5ff;background:#101a2b;color-scheme:dark}body{margin:0;padding:22px;max-width:1100px}h1{font-size:1.65rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{line-height:1.5;color:#bdcbe0}button,input{font:inherit;max-width:100%}button{background:#28476b;color:#fff;border:1px solid #7e9bbd;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 14px;cursor:pointer}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}header,section{background:#192a43;border:1px solid #354d6c;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:16px}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center}.status{min-height:24px;color:#a6edce}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.94rem}td,th{text-align:left;padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #354d6c}th{color:#abc5e4}.scroll{overflow:auto}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;background:#101a2b;padding:14px;border-radius:8px}#connection{overflow-wrap:anywhere}input[type=file]{padding:10px;background:#101a2b;border-radius:7px}@media(max-width:600px){body{padding:10px}header,section{padding:12px}td,th{padding:8px}h1{font-size:1.4rem}}[hidden]{display:none!important}
</style></head><body><header><h1>ZipRunner review</h1><p>Builds, waiting work and recorded project QA. Read-only access.</p><p id="status" class="status" role="status">Checking the Tavi host…</p><div class="actions"><label>Load ZipRunner authentication file <input id="credential" type="file" accept=".zrmobile,application/json" disabled></label><button id="refresh" disabled>Refresh</button><button id="disconnect" disabled>Clear connection</button></div><p id="connection">Locked. No ZipRunner data is requested before your authentication file is accepted.</p></header>
<main id="model" hidden><section><h2>Build workload</h2><p id="workload"></p><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Project</th><th>Work</th><th>State</th></tr></thead><tbody id="jobs"></tbody></table></div></section><section><h2>Projects</h2><div class="scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Project</th><th>Version</th><th>Build</th><th>QA</th><th>Details</th></tr></thead><tbody id="projects"></tbody></table></div></section><section id="detail-section" hidden><h2>Recorded project detail</h2><pre id="detail"></pre></section></main>
<footer><p>No build, restart, configuration, Git or release actions are exposed. Recorded success does not prove runtime health. The authentication file stays in this Tavi session's memory; clear the connection or close the panel to remove access.</p></footer><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
